OL,3,GNEWSAPolice attending serious assault
OL,4,Ain Dungannon
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are currently at the scene of a
OL,7,Fserious assault in Dungannon in County
OL,8,FTyrone.
OL,10,FThe incident happened in Lisnahull
OL,11,FRoad.
OL,13,FPolice have said the public should
OL,14,Favoid the area while enquiries
OL,15,Fcontinue.
OL,17,FFurther details will follow in due
OL,18,Fcourse.
